# Flyway checksums file bytes: line endings must never drift after a
# migration is applied anywhere. Force LF for all text sources so Windows
# checkouts cannot silently rewrite applied migrations (core.autocrlf stays
# for anything not listed here).
*.sql text eol=lf
*.java text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.tsx text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.xml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.csv text eol=lf
